<% content_for :title, "Privacy & Safeguarding Policy" %>
<% content_for :description, "Privacy and Safeguarding Policy for Connecting Hearts for Singles & Married Foundation in Warri, Delta State, Nigeria." %>

<!-- Hero Header -->
<section class="brand-gradient text-white pt-28 pb-20 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-4 relative z-10">
    <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-terracotta-300 bg-white/10 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full inline-block">Protection & Trust</span>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white">Privacy & Safeguarding Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-purple-100/90 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-sans font-light">
      Your privacy, dignity, and security are fundamental to our mission at Connecting Hearts Foundation.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-20 bg-warm-50">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">
    
    <div class="bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-warm-300 shadow-sm space-y-8 text-charcoal-800 leading-relaxed font-sans">
      
      <div class="border-b border-warm-200 pb-6 space-y-2">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-plum-700">Effective Date: July 2025 | Last Updated: 2026</span>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-plum-950">Our Commitment to Confidentiality & Safety</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-600">
          Connecting Hearts for Singles & Married Foundation ("Foundation", "we", "us", or "our"), based in Warri, Delta State, Nigeria, respects your privacy and is dedicated to safeguarding all personal and sensitive information entrusted to us.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 1. Information Collection -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-plum-900">1. Information We Collect</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-700">
          We collect personal information voluntarily provided by individuals, couples, volunteers, and partners when interacting with our Foundation. This includes:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-sm text-charcoal-700 pl-2">
          <li><strong>Contact Data:</strong> Name, phone number, WhatsApp number, and email address.</li>
          <li><strong>Support & Intake Details:</strong> Information submitted via counseling or educational support request forms detailing your relationship status, session preferences, or family circumstances.</li>
          <li><strong>Volunteer & Partnership Data:</strong> Background details, professional skills, and organization information submitted via application forms.</li>
          <li><strong>Donation Data:</strong> Transaction references and contact details for financial accounting and transparency.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Counseling Confidentiality -->
      <div class="space-y-3 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-plum-50 border border-plum-200">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-plum-950">2. Strict Counseling & Therapy Confidentiality</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed">
          All counseling requests and session notes are strictly confidential. Information shared with our certified family counselors and referral network is never disclosed to third parties without your explicit written consent, except under mandatory legal safeguarding exceptions outlined in Section 4.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. Child Safeguarding Policy -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-plum-900">3. Child Protection & Safeguarding Policy</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-700">
          Our Educational Support Pillar serves children from broken and single-parent homes. We operate under a strict zero-tolerance policy regarding child abuse, exploitation, or neglect.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-sm text-charcoal-700 pl-2">
          <li><strong>Direct School Disbursements:</strong> Educational sponsorship funds are paid directly to verified primary and secondary school accounts in Delta State, not cash hand-outs.</li>
          <li><strong>Child Dignity:</strong> We do not publish identifying photographs or full names of vulnerable children without informed parental/guardian consent.</li>
          <li><strong>Staff & Volunteer Screening:</strong> All volunteers and mentors interacting with minors undergo thorough reference and background verification.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Safeguarding Boundaries & Limitations -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-plum-900">4. Safeguarding Exceptions to Confidentiality</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-700">
          Confidentiality may be broken only when required by law or professional ethical guidelines to prevent severe harm:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-sm text-charcoal-700 pl-2">
          <li>Where there is evidence of imminent danger or risk of severe bodily harm to oneself or another person.</li>
          <li>Where child abuse, sexual abuse, or severe neglect of a minor is disclosed or suspected.</li>
          <li>Where compelled by a legally binding court order under Nigerian law.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- 5. How We Use Information -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-plum-900">5. How We Use Your Information</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-700">
          Your information is utilized solely to provide compassionate support services, coordinate counseling appointments, process academic sponsorships, respond to inquiries, and send occasional Foundation updates. We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal data to any commercial entities.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 6. Data Security -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-plum-900">6. Data Storage & Security</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-700">
          We maintain secure digital database storage with encrypted transmission protocols (SSL/TLS) and strict access controls to prevent unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 7. Contact Us for Privacy Concerns -->
      <div class="pt-6 border-t border-warm-200 space-y-3">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-plum-950">7. Contact Our Safeguarding Officer</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-700">
          If you have questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy & Safeguarding Policy, please reach out to our team:
        </p>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-warm-100 border border-warm-300 text-xs text-charcoal-800 space-y-1">
          <p><strong>Connecting Hearts for Singles & Married Foundation</strong></p>
          <p>📍 Warri, Delta State, Nigeria</p>
          <p>✉ Email: <a href="mailto:contact@connectingheartsng.org" class="text-plum-800 underline font-bold">contact@connectingheartsng.org</a></p>
          <p>📞 Phone / WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/2349013732353" target="_blank" class="text-plum-800 underline font-bold">+2349013732353</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
